ear window. That is why many boxes start at 0.","Mean versus median: the mean is above the median in 6 of 8 years, because a few highly cited works pull the average up. The widest gap is 2019: mean 0.84, median 0, top work 5.95. The median is the better guide to a typical work.","Small base: the values for 2010–2013, 2017 and 2019–2021 are based on only 10–29 works (lighter box or hollow point), so read them with care.","Few works: 2015, 2018, 2022 and 2025 have fewer than 10 works, too few for a box. Each of those works is drawn as a dot."],"citations":["Typical work: works published 2010–2021 have a median of 0–2.5 citations each; the highest median (2.5) is in 2013.","Most cited works: the top 10% of works published in 2011 have at least 6.4 citations each, the highest P90 in the chart.","Not yet cited: more than half of the works published 2017–2021 have no citations so far. This is expected for recent works and is not a sign of low quality.","Small base: the values for 2010–2013, 2017 and 2019–2021 are based on only 10–29 works (lighter box or hollow point), so read them with care.","Few works: 2015, 2018, 2022 and 2025 have fewer than 10 works, too few for a band. Each of those works is drawn as a dot."]}}}